  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The power of your spirit-shout beggars description.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Mighty Kiai<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your Kiai deals sonic damage equal to five times your Wisdom modifier, and creatures failing their saving throw against it are stunned for 1 round and then staggered for 1 round. A successful save results in half damage and negates stunning but not staggering. The damage and effects are cumulative with Greater Kiai and Improved Kiai.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
